---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = "Top Hospitals with International Departments in China";
const description = "China's best A++++ ranked hospitals with International Departments (国际部) for foreign visitors — sorted by city.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="fr">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/fr/life/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        Retour à la Vie en Chine
      </a>
    </nav>
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">🏥 Medical Care</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        Top Hospitals with International Departments in China
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">All ranked A++++ (highest tier) by the Fudan University Hospital Comprehensive Ranking.</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 Last updated: June 2026</span>
        <span>⏱️ 5 min read</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-12 not-prose">
      <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm">All hospitals listed are rated <strong>A++++</strong> in the 2024 Fudan University Hospital Comprehensive Ranking. Specialty rankings are from the same Fudan specialty rankings, covering over 40 clinical specialties based on expert peer review.</p>
      <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs mt-2">Source: https://rank.cn-healthcare.com/fudan/national-general/year/2024</p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🏥</span> Pékin (5 hospitals)
      </h2>

      <div class="space-y-6 mb-12 not-prose">
        <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-blue-900 mb-2">Peking Union Medical College Hospital (北京协和医院)</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700"><strong>Top specialties:</strong> #1 in China overall. Rheumatology, Ob/Gyn, Endocrinology, Radiology, and Nuclear Medicine consistently rank in the national top 2.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-blue-900 mb-2">PLA General Hospital (中国人民解放军总医院 / 301)</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700"><strong>Top specialties:</strong> China's largest military hospital. ENT, Orthopedics, and Nephrology rank in the national top 3.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-blue-900 mb-2">Pékin Tiantan Hospital (首都医科大学附属北京天坛医院)</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700"><strong>Top specialties:</strong> Neurosurgery and Neurology rank #1 nationally — China's largest brain center.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-blue-900 mb-2">Pékin Anzhen Hospital (首都医科大学附属北京安贞医院)</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700"><strong>Top specialties:</strong> Cardiology and Cardiovascular Surgery rank in the national top 3. Performs over 20,000 heart surgeries annually.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-blue-900 mb-2">Cancer Hospital Chinese Academy of Medical Sciences (中国医学科学院肿瘤医院)</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700"><strong>Top specialties:</strong> Oncology ranks #1 nationally. Home to China's National Cancer Center.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🏥</span> Shanghai (6 hospitals)
      </h2>

      <div class="space-y-6 mb-12 not-prose">
        <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-green-900 mb-2">Zhongshan Hospital, Fudan University (复旦大学附属中山医院)</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700"><strong>Top specialties:</strong> #1 in Shanghai overall. Cardiology and Liver Surgery rank in the national top 3.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-green-900 mb-2">Ruijin Hospital, Shanghai Jiao Tong University (上海交通大学医学院附属瑞金医院)</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700"><strong>Top specialties:</strong> Endocrinology #1 nationally, Hematology #1 nationally. Burns and Respiratory Medicine also in national top 3.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-green-900 mb-2">Huashan Hospital, Fudan University (复旦大学附属华山医院)</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700"><strong>Top specialties:</strong> Dermatology #1 nationally, Neurosurgery #2 nationally. Most popular hospital among expats in Shanghai.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-green-900 mb-2">Fudan University Shanghai Cancer Center (复旦大学附属肿瘤医院)</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700"><strong>Top specialties:</strong> Oncology in national top 3. Largest cancer hospital in East China.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-green-900 mb-2">Shanghai Ninth People's Hospital (上海交通大学医学院附属第九人民医院)</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700"><strong>Top specialties:</strong> Plastic Surgery #1 nationally, Stomatology in top 2. Orthopedics in top 10.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-green-900 mb-2">Children's Hospital of Fudan University (复旦大学附属儿科医院)</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700"><strong>Top specialties:</strong> Pediatrics #1 nationally. International clinic with English-speaking doctors.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🏥</span> Guangzhou (2 hospitals)
      </h2>

      <div class="space-y-6 mb-12 not-prose">
        <div class="bg-purple-50 border border-purple-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-purple-900 mb-2">The First Affiliated Hospital, Sun Yat-sen University (中山大学附属第一医院)</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700"><strong>Top specialties:</strong> #1 in Southern China. Nephrology and Gastroenterology rank in national top 3.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-purple-50 border border-purple-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-purple-900 mb-2">Sun Yat-sen University Cancer Center (中山大学附属肿瘤医院)</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700"><strong>Top specialties:</strong> Oncology in national top 5. World-leading in nasopharyngeal carcinoma treatment.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🏥</span> Other Major Cities
      </h2>

      <div class="space-y-6 mb-12 not-prose">
        <div class="bg-orange-50 border border-orange-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-orange-900 mb-1">West China Hospital, Sichuan University</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-2">Chengdu</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700"><strong>Top specialties:</strong> #1 in Southwest China, top 5 nationally. Anesthesiology #1, Respiratory Medicine top 3.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-orange-50 border border-orange-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-orange-900 mb-1">Tongji Hospital, Tongji Medical College</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-2">Wuhan</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700"><strong>Top specialties:</strong> Ob/Gyn in national top 3, Urology in top 5.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-orange-50 border border-orange-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-orange-900 mb-1">Union Hospital, Tongji Medical College</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-2">Wuhan</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700"><strong>Top specialties:</strong> Hematology in national top 3, Cardiovascular Surgery in top 5.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-orange-50 border border-orange-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-orange-900 mb-1">The First Affiliated Hospital of Zhejiang University</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-2">Hangzhou</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700"><strong>Top specialties:</strong> Top 5 in East China. Infectious Diseases #1 nationally.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-orange-50 border border-orange-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-orange-900 mb-1">Xijing Hospital, Air Force Medical University</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-2">Xi'an</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700"><strong>Top specialties:</strong> Gastroenterology #1 nationally, Burns in top 3.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-orange-50 border border-orange-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-orange-900 mb-1">The First Hospital of China Medical University</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-2">Shenyang</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700"><strong>Top specialties:</strong> #1 in Northeast China. Dermatology and Orthopedics in national top 10.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-orange-50 border border-orange-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-orange-900 mb-1">Nanjing Drum Tower Hospital (南京鼓楼医院)</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-2">Nanjing</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700"><strong>Top specialties:</strong> Rheumatology in national top 5. Leading reproductive medicine center.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Related Guides -->
    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose mt-12">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">📚 Related Guides</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/fr/life/seeing-a-doctor/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Seeing a Doctor in China</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Clinics, hospitals, and what to expect</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/fr/life/travel-insurance/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Travel Insurance for China</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">What you need before you go</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/fr/life/emergency-numbers/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Emergency Numbers & What to Do</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Save these before you need them</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>